<h1>Dr Mostafa Sedky | Consultant Breast Surgeon in Cairo</h1>
<p>&nbsp;Dr Mostafa Sedky is a consultant breast surgeon based in Abbasiyah, Cairo, providing specialist care for breast assessment, breast cancer, reconstructive surgery and aesthetic breast procedures. The clinic offers private consultations with a focus on careful assessment, clear surgical guidance and personalised care from the first concern through recovery. Patients can arrange a one-to-one consultation, receive evidence-based treatment options and benefit from dedicated follow-up.</p>
